{"id":"u-7c46d776-0dc4-4b74-b22d-f8944925163b","src":"community","title":"COOZ program.","author":"Josh Boggess","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/cooz-program","desc":"Dude. This program is very hard. Like I made it…very…hard. Each week, for every wave of three weeks, your lifts will take longer. The idea behind this program isn’t going balls to the wall every set, but strategically using RPE and %1RM to add volume. Volume will make you grow! Volume is king! Just STICK TO IT. Since not every set is a 10/10 effort, you need to really try and get everything done…no slacking. Only 4 days a week, but they’re hard days!\n\nYou’ve got this. For weeks 7-9, you would do the same thing, but add2-4% on percentage based lifts, and cut reps down to 10s for accessory work.\n\nMoral of the story: stick with it and trust the process. This will be good!","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":80,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:49:02.290Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Squat(Quad Focus) and Back","Day 2","Posterior Chain + Back","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60},{"r":8,"pct":70},{"r":6,"pct":75},{"r":4,"pct":80},{"r":2,"pct":70}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"pct":70}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8},{"r":12,"rpe":8},{"r":10,"rpe":8}],"note":"Use the same weight every set(or plan to). The fatigue should drag down you rep count if you aren’t resting too long. Then, you don’t need to worry about changing weight mid-exercise. +5LBS every week"},{"n":"Leg Press (45 Degrees)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8.5,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Assisted)","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8.5,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":15,"rpe":8.5,"rpeHi":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Paused)","sets":[{"r":10,"pct":60},{"r":8,"pct":70},{"r":6,"pct":75},{"r":4,"pct":80}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbel